        <briefdescription>
<para>emitAssembly - Print the frametable. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The ocaml frametable format is thus:</para>
<para>extern &quot;C&quot; struct align(sizeof(intptr_t)) { <ref refid="classuint16__t" kindref="compound">uint16_t</ref> NumDescriptors; struct align(sizeof(intptr_t)) { void *ReturnAddress; <ref refid="classuint16__t" kindref="compound">uint16_t</ref> FrameSize; <ref refid="classuint16__t" kindref="compound">uint16_t</ref> NumLiveOffsets; <ref refid="classuint16__t" kindref="compound">uint16_t</ref> LiveOffsets[NumLiveOffsets]; } Descriptors[NumDescriptors]; } caml${module}__frametable;</para>
<para>Note that this precludes programs from stack frames larger than 64K (FrameSize and LiveOffsets would overflow). FrameTablePrinter will abort if either condition is detected in a function which uses the GC. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
